        },
        "mid": "?"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "It starts inside big storm clouds. Tiny bits of ice bump and rub together as the wind tosses them around.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "⛈️",
        "text": "Ice bits bump around",
        "cue": "ice",
        "sub": "Inside storm clouds",
        "sub_cue": "storm"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Why does bumping matter?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Scientists think all that bumping builds up electric charge, a bit like the zap you get from a fuzzy rug.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "⚡",
        "text": "Charge builds up",
        "cue": "charge",
        "sub": "Like a tiny zap",
        "sub_cue": "zap"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "And then what?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "When there's too much charge, it jumps in a giant spark. That giant spark is lightning!",
      "punch": "lightning",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "⚡",
        "text": "A giant spark!",
        "cue": "spark"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "So what's the thunder?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Lightning heats the air so fast that the air bursts outward with a BOOM. That boom is thunder!",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "Making thunder",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Lightning flash",
            "icon": "⚡",
            "cue": "lightning"
          },
          {
            "label": "Air heats super fast",
            "icon": "🔥",
            "cue": "heats"
          },
          {
            "label": "BOOM!",
            "icon": "🔊",
            "cue": "boom"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Why do I see the flash before I hear the boom?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Light travels much faster than sound. So the flash reaches your eyes first, and the rumble comes later.",
      "board": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "label": "Light",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Fast flash",
              "icon": "👀",
